(Kodo RV-9 Robot Vacuum - Quick Start) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Place the charging dock against a wall with 0.5 m free on each side and 1.5 m in) Tj T*
(front.) Tj T*
(2. Charge the robot fully before the first run \(about 4 hours\).) Tj T*
(3. Install the Kodo Home app and add the robot over 2.4 GHz Wi-Fi. 5 GHz networks are) Tj T*
(not supported.) Tj T*
(4. The first run builds a map of your home. Open all doors and pick up cables and socks.) Tj T*
(5. In the app you can draw no-go zones, for example around the dog bowl.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Maintenance) Tj T*
(Empty the dust bin after every run. Clean the main brush every week and replace it every) Tj T*
(6 to 12 months. Replace the filter every 3 months.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Status lights and errors) Tj T*
(Blinking red with error 2: the main brush is stuck; remove hair and threads. Error 5:) Tj T*
(the bumper is stuck. Error 8: the robot cannot find the dock.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Warranty) Tj T*
(12 months on the robot, 6 months on the battery.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
